OL,13,G0350 Witness History
OL,14,     FOn an English field in 1957,
OL,15,     Fbuilding finished on what was then
OL,16,     Fthe largest radio telescope in the
OL,17,     Fworld. The mastermind behind the
OL,18,     F76 metre wide dish was Sir Bernard
OL,19,     FLovell.
